            text-decoration:none;
            padding:12px 28px;
            border-radius:6px;
            border:2px solid #CC0000;
            margin:0 8px 12px">
    Unsubscribe
  </a>

  <div style="margin-top:24px"></div>

  <!-- Legal footer -->
  <p style="font-size:11px;color:#aaaaaa;margin:0">
    You are receiving this email because you submitted 
    an enquiry through our website.
  </p>

</div>`;

// ── Email subjects ────────────────────────────────────
const subjects = [
  `Hi ${firstName}, just checking in!`,
  `${firstName}, a quick thought for you`,
  `Final note from us, ${firstName}`
];

// ── Email bodies ──────────────────────────────────────
const bodies = [

  `<p>Hi ${firstName},</p>
  <p>I wanted to follow up on your recent enquiry.
  We would love to help <strong>${lead.company}</strong>
  achieve great results.</p>
  <p>Would you be open to a quick conversation this week?
  Simply reply to this email and we will take it
  from there.</p>
  <p>Best regards,<br>The Team</p>
  ${unsubscribeFooter}`,

  `<p>Hi ${firstName},</p>
  <p>I wanted to share something relevant for a company
  like <strong>${lead.company}</strong>.</p>
  <p>We have helped businesses with a similar profile
  significantly improve their results. I would love to
  share how — just reply to this email and I will
  send the details across.</p>
  <p>Best regards,<br>The Team</p>
  ${unsubscribeFooter}`,

  `<p>Hi ${firstName},</p>
  <p>This will be my last follow-up — I don't want
  to crowd your inbox.</p>
  <p>If the timing isn't right, no worries at all.
  Whenever you are ready, simply reply to this email
  and we will pick up from there.</p>
  <p>Best regards,<br>The Team</p>
  ${unsubscribeFooter}`

];

// ── Return output ─────────────────────────────────────
return [{
  json: {
    ...lead,
    followup_subject:  subjects[count],
    followup_body:     bodies[count],
    next_count:        count + 1,
    followup_number:   count + 1,
    unsubscribe_url:   unsubscribeUrl,
    unsubscribe_token: token
  }
}];

